// SEAM001: an inline foreign block stops the build at the seam
// `polyglot.inline` (PROP-009 section 17): no engine runs one yet (M58),
// so it never parses and then fails late, or silently, somewhere else.
// The seam is reported at the word `py`, line 7, column 5.
fn main() {
    print("before");
    py { print("hi") }
}
